1
00:00:47,476 --> 00:00:52,470
=The Outlaw=

2
00:00:52,471 --> 00:00:55,880
(This story is entirely fictional.
All settings are imaginary.)

3
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:58,680
=Episode 3=

4
00:01:03,759 --> 00:01:04,560
No green.

5
00:01:05,120 --> 00:01:05,840
Still no green.

6
00:01:05,841 --> 00:01:07,680
Red jadeite isn't supposed to be green.

7
00:01:10,680 --> 00:01:11,400
My kidney...

8
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:12,760
You're not taking it.

9
00:01:13,159 --> 00:01:13,560
Buddy,

10
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:15,480
didn't you say
you don't know jade betting?

11
00:01:15,719 --> 00:01:16,519
I don't.

12
00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:18,359
But I know the fake junk
that fooled my dad.

13
00:01:19,359 --> 00:01:20,159
Hey, handsome.

14
00:01:20,519 --> 00:01:22,799
Whatever jade you uncover,
the house gets 90% and you get 10%.

15
00:01:23,319 --> 00:01:24,760
I'll take this red jadeite.

16
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:26,599
I'll credit you 10% for it.

17
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:30,359
Ten percent?

18
00:01:30,799 --> 00:01:31,280
Hey,

19
00:01:31,680 --> 00:01:32,879
ten percent is still something.

20
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:34,480
Better than coming up empty.

21
00:01:34,760 --> 00:01:35,959
Right, my friend from Huaguo?

22
00:01:36,519 --> 00:01:37,640
You never told me that!

23
00:01:38,640 --> 00:01:40,120
If we told you everything,

24
00:01:40,121 --> 00:01:42,319
who'd be dumb enough
to come into the back room?

25
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:45,319
No, no!

26
00:01:45,320 --> 00:01:46,079
Hear me out.

27
00:01:46,080 --> 00:01:46,920
Let's talk this through.

28
00:01:46,921 --> 00:01:47,439
Hear me out.

29
00:01:47,440 --> 00:01:48,640
Buddy, take the 10%.

30
00:01:48,920 --> 00:01:49,280
Ten percent.

31
00:01:49,281 --> 00:01:50,680
Works for you, works for me.

32
00:01:51,159 --> 00:01:51,840
Works for everyone!

33
00:01:52,159 --> 00:01:53,239
Better than losing a kidney, right?

34
00:01:53,240 --> 00:01:53,800
Buddy!

35
00:01:54,560 --> 00:01:55,000
Buddy!

36
00:01:55,959 --> 00:01:56,560
You're a shill!

37
00:01:58,719 --> 00:01:59,000
Me?

38
00:01:59,680 --> 00:01:59,959
I...

39
00:02:00,359 --> 00:02:00,640
I...

40
00:02:09,319 --> 00:02:10,240
Go after him!

41
00:02:10,479 --> 00:02:11,280
Useless idiots!

42
00:02:13,159 --> 00:02:14,199
There he is! Get him!

43
00:02:16,159 --> 00:02:16,759
Stop there!

44
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:23,159
Boss,

45
00:02:23,919 --> 00:02:24,960
deal or no deal,

46
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:27,159
you still owe me 10,000
as a finder's fee.

47
00:02:27,439 --> 00:02:28,400
This is the rule, right?

48
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:33,759
Where were you trying to run off to?

49
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:36,479
If we don't catch him,

50
00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:38,560
your kidney pays the debt.

51
00:02:39,919 --> 00:02:41,400
Boss, I'm sorry.

52
00:02:41,401 --> 00:02:42,520
Forget the money.

53
00:02:42,521 --> 00:02:43,360
Can I just go?

54
00:02:45,361 --> 00:02:46,919
You bring me some clueless rookie

55
00:02:46,920 --> 00:02:48,039
just to pocket my money?

56
00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:49,800
He didn't make me a dime,

57
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:50,800
and now you want to escape?

58
00:02:56,960 --> 00:02:57,800
Don't hit me!

59
00:02:57,801 --> 00:02:58,759
Please, stop!

60
00:02:59,319 --> 00:02:59,960
Stop!

61
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:02,800
(He deserves it.)

62
00:03:03,199 --> 00:03:04,240
(He sold me out first.)

63
00:03:04,719 --> 00:03:05,479
(Not my problem.)

64
00:03:16,520 --> 00:03:17,520
Whoa! That was awesome!

65
00:03:17,719 --> 00:03:18,220
Let's go!

66
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:24,520
Move!

67
00:03:24,759 --> 00:03:25,879
Don't be so quick to get on your knees.

68
00:03:27,039 --> 00:03:28,639
Beat that punk to death!

69
00:03:37,640 --> 00:03:38,400
So tell me, buddy.

70
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:40,159
I tricked you.
Why'd you come back for me?

71
00:03:40,160 --> 00:03:41,960
I grew up getting beaten just like that.

72
00:03:41,961 --> 00:03:42,960
That's when I learned

73
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:45,000
you can't back down from a mad dog,
or it'll bite you to death.

74
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:46,120
I'm sorry.

75
00:03:46,319 --> 00:03:46,719
From now on,

76
00:03:47,039 --> 00:03:48,199
I'm with you.

77
00:03:48,200 --> 00:03:48,840
Save it.

78
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:50,120
We'll settle this later. Move!

79
00:03:51,159 --> 00:03:51,599
After them!

80
00:03:51,880 --> 00:03:52,219
Go! Go!

81
00:03:52,220 --> 00:03:52,400
Stop!

82
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:53,280
- Don't you dare run!
- Don't you dare run!

83
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:55,080
Stop!

84
00:03:59,620 --> 00:04:00,120
Don't you dare run!

85
00:04:00,220 --> 00:04:01,120
Stop!

86
00:04:03,719 --> 00:04:04,560
Come catch me!

87
00:04:04,561 --> 00:04:05,919
Think you can catch my taillights?

88
00:04:09,260 --> 00:04:09,920
Stop!

89
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:10,760
Don't run!

90
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:12,479
What's wrong?

91
00:04:12,759 --> 00:04:13,599
This thing's a relic.

92
00:04:13,599 --> 00:04:15,000
It can't haul two people uphill.

93
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:16,959
I'm saving up to replace it.

94
00:04:16,960 --> 00:04:17,360
Don't run!

95
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:20,500
- Stop!
- Stop!

96
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:23,879
- Take them out!
- Take them out!

97
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:46,839
Whoa!

98
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:48,560
She's gorgeous!

99
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:50,040
Try coming any closer!

100
00:04:51,319 --> 00:04:51,839
Come here!

101
00:04:56,439 --> 00:04:57,439
Hey, wait for me!

102
00:05:01,580 --> 00:05:02,000
Don't run!

103
00:05:03,839 --> 00:05:04,319
Mona.

104
00:05:04,320 --> 00:05:05,160
Thanks for today.

105
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:06,240
Let's toast to it.

106
00:05:10,199 --> 00:05:10,720
Come on.

107
00:05:10,721 --> 00:05:11,959
Food's here!

108
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:15,160
Come on.

109
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:19,959
Dig in.

110
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:24,000
Hey.

111
00:05:24,199 --> 00:05:25,399
What kind of junk bike is that?

112
00:05:26,079 --> 00:05:27,519
We almost died on it today.

113
00:05:28,160 --> 00:05:29,759
I told you. It's a relic.

114
00:05:30,319 --> 00:05:30,800
Exactly.

115
00:05:30,959 --> 00:05:32,879
I'm saving what I make off you
to replace it.

116
00:05:33,279 --> 00:05:35,279
Once I take Sihan home,
I'll buy you a new one.

117
00:05:35,280 --> 00:05:35,759
Deal!

118
00:05:35,760 --> 00:05:36,959
Get me one with a bigger engine.

119
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:37,600
All right!

120
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:41,160
Hey, gorgeous.

121
00:05:41,720 --> 00:05:42,160
Hi.

122
00:05:42,519 --> 00:05:43,199
I'm Ma Ding.

123
00:05:43,560 --> 00:05:44,639
Ma as in mighty,

124
00:05:44,640 --> 00:05:45,680
Ding as in ding-dong.

125
00:05:50,639 --> 00:05:51,160
Hi.

126
00:05:51,839 --> 00:05:52,600
Shy, huh?

127
00:05:53,839 --> 00:05:54,759
You saved us today.

128
00:05:54,760 --> 00:05:55,839
Won't those guys come after you?

129
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:01,040
I'm a nurse.

130
00:06:01,639 --> 00:06:02,720
They're gangsters.

131
00:06:03,319 --> 00:06:05,759
When they get stabbed or shot,
they can't go to big hospitals.

132
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:06,800
So they come to me.

133
00:06:06,801 --> 00:06:07,920
I patch them up on the side.

134
00:06:08,120 --> 00:06:09,399
So they'd show me some respect.

135
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:12,759
Running into you
at the hospital was one thing.

136
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:14,040
But twice?

137
00:06:14,041 --> 00:06:14,879
Was that really a coincidence?

138
00:06:16,839 --> 00:06:17,519
Yeah.

139
00:06:17,839 --> 00:06:19,720
I was delivering medicine
to a client today.

140
00:06:19,959 --> 00:06:21,600
Then I saw you two fighting.

141
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:22,920
Crazy coincidence.

142
00:06:22,921 --> 00:06:24,600
Delivering medicine? Dressed like that?

143
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:27,839
You don't get it.

144
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:29,160
If you ride a motorcycle,

145
00:06:29,319 --> 00:06:30,639
you gotta look the part.

146
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:31,600
Right, gorgeous?

147
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:32,920
Ma Ding gets it.

148
00:06:33,199 --> 00:06:34,160
Sure.

149
00:06:39,439 --> 00:06:40,040
Oh, right.

150
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:43,199
Why was there a hidden camera
in the clothes you lent me?

151
00:06:44,720 --> 00:06:46,600
I rented them from a friend's shop.

152
00:06:47,160 --> 00:06:48,279
It didn't get you in trouble, did it?

153
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:49,399
You really didn't know?

154
00:06:49,879 --> 00:06:50,639
If I knew,

155
00:06:50,640 --> 00:06:52,040
why would I give them to you?

156
00:06:56,519 --> 00:06:59,279
Anyway, once I trade the red jadeite
for an invitation,

157
00:06:59,280 --> 00:07:00,560
I'll take Sihan home right away.

158
00:07:01,839 --> 00:07:02,800
I don't want any trouble.

159
00:07:03,439 --> 00:07:04,439
And the money you lent me,

160
00:07:04,440 --> 00:07:05,759
I'll send it back once I'm home.

161
00:07:07,920 --> 00:07:08,360
Okay.

162
00:07:08,839 --> 00:07:11,279
At least for the money I put in,
you'd better pull this off.

163
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:12,560
I will.

164
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:21,480
(Langia Autumn Jade Auction)

165
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:37,280
(Natuo, One of Langia's Big Three)

166
00:07:38,160 --> 00:07:39,000
Three hundred thousand

167
00:07:39,319 --> 00:07:40,600
for this lousy ticket?

168
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:44,959
Sihan!

169
00:07:45,839 --> 00:07:46,279
Sihan!

170
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:49,279
Sihan!

171
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:51,160
What's going on?

172
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:52,800
Nothing, sir. Let's go.

173
00:07:53,519 --> 00:07:53,959
Sihan!

174
00:07:54,959 --> 00:07:55,399
Sihan!

175
00:07:56,439 --> 00:07:56,800
Wait!

176
00:07:57,199 --> 00:07:57,839
What are you doing?

177
00:08:02,639 --> 00:08:03,319
Sorry.

178
00:08:04,720 --> 00:08:05,319
What do you mean?

179
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:06,480
Why won't you let me in?

180
00:08:06,959 --> 00:08:08,759
You have a fake invitation
and you're asking why?

181
00:08:09,079 --> 00:08:09,639
Get out of here.

182
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:11,040
Fake?

183
00:08:11,439 --> 00:08:13,240
I paid ten million for this!
How can it be fake?

184
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:14,600
Ten million for a piece of paper?

185
00:08:14,759 --> 00:08:15,480
What an idiot.

186
00:08:15,639 --> 00:08:17,240
Real guests don't need invitations.

187
00:08:17,519 --> 00:08:18,560
Just a quick face scan.

188
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:20,040
We're done.

189
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:21,040
You got scammed.

190
00:08:22,519 --> 00:08:23,160
Daya!

191
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:25,480
I need to see someone.
I'll be right back.

192
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:26,040
I...

193
00:08:26,839 --> 00:08:27,040
Hey!

194
00:08:27,319 --> 00:08:28,240
Hey!

195
00:08:34,679 --> 00:08:35,240
Look!

196
00:08:35,639 --> 00:08:37,600
Isn't that Ms. Layla's car
from Songcai Group?

197
00:08:38,919 --> 00:08:39,799
Her family controls

198
00:08:39,800 --> 00:08:41,559
all the jade business in Langia.

199
00:08:41,560 --> 00:08:41,919
But...

200
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:42,639
Whoa!

201
00:08:43,120 --> 00:08:43,480
Look!

202
00:08:45,559 --> 00:08:46,080
Hey!

203
00:08:46,679 --> 00:08:48,759
Boss Suowen is furious.

204
00:08:49,120 --> 00:08:50,159
Come back with me.

205
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:00,960
Ms. Layla.

206
00:09:01,759 --> 00:09:03,120
I'm a jade dealer from Huaguo.

207
00:09:03,121 --> 00:09:04,000
I'd like to discuss a deal with you.

208
00:09:04,519 --> 00:09:06,440
He's the Huaguo guy who cut open a stone
and got red jadeite.

209
00:09:06,441 --> 00:09:07,639
I heard he's here
looking for his girlfriend.

210
00:09:07,640 --> 00:09:09,360
(Hudie, Layla's Henchman)
His girlfriend is Natuo's new favorite.

211
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:15,080
He struck it rich.
Why didn't he just leave?

212
00:09:15,759 --> 00:09:16,960
Take him back.

213
00:09:17,399 --> 00:09:18,159
Now!

214
00:09:24,279 --> 00:09:24,759
Say you're sorry.

215
00:09:25,039 --> 00:09:25,960
Sorry.

216
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:27,120
Sorry, Ms. Layla.

217
00:09:28,120 --> 00:09:29,000
This guy showed up

218
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:30,519
with a fake invitation.

219
00:09:31,039 --> 00:09:32,559
I was just helping you
clear out the troublemakers.

220
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:34,679
Dashan.

221
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:37,840
We don't need outsiders
clearing our place for us.

222
00:09:39,759 --> 00:09:40,600
That's not what I meant.

223
00:09:43,639 --> 00:09:44,480
As for you,

224
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:46,600
the dealer from Huaguo,

225
00:09:47,039 --> 00:09:48,720
you want to work with me? Fine.

226
00:09:49,360 --> 00:09:50,720
Show me what you can do.

227
00:09:50,919 --> 00:09:52,840
Let's see if you're worth
making an exception for.

228
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:53,399
All right.

229
00:10:01,799 --> 00:10:03,600
Her husband's bedridden, unable to move.

230
00:10:03,601 --> 00:10:04,399
She's practically a widow.

231
00:10:04,919 --> 00:10:05,559
Good luck.

232
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:08,039
Wait.

233
00:10:08,559 --> 00:10:09,279
You can't go in.

234
00:10:09,320 --> 00:10:10,000
We're together.

235
00:10:10,080 --> 00:10:10,799
You still can't go in.

236
00:10:10,800 --> 00:10:11,159
We're together!

237
00:10:11,160 --> 00:10:12,159
Sorry. You can't enter.

238
00:10:16,440 --> 00:10:17,799
Ladies and gentlemen,

239
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:20,519
the jade appraisal event

240
00:10:20,919 --> 00:10:21,919
will now

241
00:10:21,920 --> 00:10:22,799
begin.

242
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:25,039
As always,

243
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:26,360
we'll start with our first ritual.

244
00:10:26,759 --> 00:10:27,300
Welcome

245
00:10:27,400 --> 00:10:28,080
Mian.

246
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:45,399
Pay respects to Mian.

247
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:50,720
Greetings!

248
00:10:50,800 --> 00:10:52,120
(Ren, Mian's Staff Bearer)

249
00:10:53,320 --> 00:10:54,919
Mian's blessings run deep.

250
00:10:55,399 --> 00:10:56,600
- Sihan.
- (Every business in Langia)

251
00:10:57,279 --> 00:10:58,399
- Sihan.
- (thrives under)

252
00:10:58,400 --> 00:10:59,159
- Sihan.
- (Mian's protection.)

253
00:10:59,160 --> 00:10:59,799
Sihan.

254
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:00,720
As tradition demands,

255
00:11:01,120 --> 00:11:02,759
30% of whatever you win today,

256
00:11:02,919 --> 00:11:04,120
no matter how much,

257
00:11:05,080 --> 00:11:06,200
goes to

258
00:11:06,679 --> 00:11:07,479
Mian

259
00:11:07,480 --> 00:11:08,279
as tribute.

260
00:11:08,840 --> 00:11:09,320
All right,

261
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:10,320
everyone,

262
00:11:10,759 --> 00:11:12,080
show us what you've got.

263
00:11:12,799 --> 00:11:13,399
Mr. Natuo.

264
00:11:13,799 --> 00:11:14,679
I need to use the restroom.

265
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:16,200
Go ahead.

266
00:11:22,759 --> 00:11:24,080
Why did you follow me to Langia?

267
00:11:24,200 --> 00:11:24,679
Sihan.

268
00:11:24,919 --> 00:11:26,120
Langia will eat you alive.

269
00:11:26,360 --> 00:11:27,120
Come home with me.

270
00:11:27,480 --> 00:11:28,039
It's not safe here.

271
00:11:28,919 --> 00:11:29,600
So what?

272
00:11:31,559 --> 00:11:32,480
I'm not going back with you.

273
00:11:36,759 --> 00:11:37,279
Hey.

274
00:11:39,279 --> 00:11:41,639
So you're the piggy
everyone's looking for?

275
00:11:42,480 --> 00:11:43,799
Touch my woman again,

276
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:45,799
and you'll leave on a stretcher.

277
00:11:47,039 --> 00:11:47,960
Let her go.

278
00:11:48,159 --> 00:11:49,440
Come on! Hit me! Fight me!

279
00:11:49,480 --> 00:11:50,919
Come on.

280
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:51,720
Come on!

281
00:11:52,080 --> 00:11:52,879
You wanna take her?

282
00:11:53,679 --> 00:11:54,799
Then let's play a little game.

283
00:11:56,360 --> 00:11:57,039
What game?

284
00:11:57,879 --> 00:11:59,279
Since you hit the jackpot

285
00:11:59,480 --> 00:12:00,279
in the back room on Jade Street.

286
00:12:00,519 --> 00:12:01,679
Let's bet on rough jade.

287
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:02,759
If you win,

288
00:12:03,279 --> 00:12:04,600
you take her.

289
00:12:05,279 --> 00:12:06,320
If you lose,

290
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:07,840
you die here.

291
00:12:08,159 --> 00:12:08,560
You in?

292
00:12:11,799 --> 00:12:12,320
Fine.

293
00:12:13,799 --> 00:12:14,600
You've got guts.

294
00:12:15,279 --> 00:12:15,799
I'll be waiting.

295
00:12:17,800 --> 00:12:19,279
Bring out our best rough jade.

296
00:12:56,360 --> 00:12:57,360
Still haven't picked?

297
00:12:57,559 --> 00:12:58,600
Why not give up now?

298
00:12:59,879 --> 00:13:00,879
I'll only take one leg.

299
00:13:11,879 --> 00:13:12,320
This one.

300
00:13:13,480 --> 00:13:14,440
Once you choose, it's final.

301
00:13:14,960 --> 00:13:15,519
Everyone,

302
00:13:15,879 --> 00:13:16,720
