303
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:18,039
We're betting on Natuo!

304
00:13:18,960 --> 00:13:20,120
Everyone's betting on him.

305
00:13:35,759 --> 00:13:36,360
What are you up to?

306
00:13:37,480 --> 00:13:38,080
Nothing.

307
00:13:38,960 --> 00:13:39,759
Just hedging my bets.

308
00:13:40,559 --> 00:13:41,639
I don't make losing bets.

309
00:13:48,039 --> 00:13:48,399
Come on.

310
00:13:49,360 --> 00:13:49,900
Cut it.

311
00:14:28,000 --> 00:14:30,679
Excellent translucency. Vividly green.
Imperial green jadeite.

312
00:14:31,399 --> 00:14:32,000
Piggy,

313
00:14:33,039 --> 00:14:33,840
