314
00:14:34,799 --> 00:14:35,799
Don't let me down.

315
00:14:36,080 --> 00:14:36,639
Okay?

316
00:14:39,279 --> 00:14:39,799
Zhou Yan.

317
00:14:40,279 --> 00:14:41,440
You'll never get that lucky.

318
00:14:47,720 --> 00:14:48,240
Cut it.

319
00:14:56,519 --> 00:14:57,360
Get out of here, now!

320
00:15:34,080 --> 00:15:34,799
Huaguo punk.

321
00:15:35,840 --> 00:15:36,840
Looks like today

322
00:15:37,240 --> 00:15:38,360
